		"outcome": {"up": "Coyle read the rota twice, and then, slowly, crossed his own name into the twelfth row. 'A broom,' he said. 'The cleanest watch the garrison ever stood. Nine winters, and the first thing we needed was somebody to sweep.' He put his cap on and took it off again, and went to find a broom.",
