					{"at": Vector2(319.6, -37.2), "text": "A second socket, on the island, fifty paces on, with an iron ring set in it, rusted, and a hook. A lamp was to have hung here. The ring is bright where a hand has held it, a hand that came, and looked, and did not hang anything."},
